usage: evaluate_trajectory.py [-h] --training TRAINING --manifest MANIFEST
                              --raw-root RAW_ROOT --output OUTPUT
                              [--python PYTHON]
                              [--sw-batch-size SW_BATCH_SIZE] [--smoke]
                              [--plan]

Sequential internal-four evaluation of immutable periodic and final weights.
Run after training completes. This runner never evaluates the original eight,
never changes training weights, and never selects a new final checkpoint.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --training TRAINING
  --manifest MANIFEST
  --raw-root RAW_ROOT
  --output OUTPUT
  --python PYTHON
  --sw-batch-size SW_BATCH_SIZE
  --smoke
  --plan
